# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never publish. See corpus/README.md.
#
# private/ holds the three real questionnaires, the compiled framework
# crosswalk, the peer benchmark from a confidential assessment, and the
# per-concept writing context derived from all of it. The questionnaire text
# belongs to whoever wrote it, the vendor instrument behind q2 is a commercial
# product, and the assessment identifies its subject.
#
# The repo builds and tests without any of it, against corpus/synthetic.tsv.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
